-- ============================================================
-- BULK DEMO DATA - generated for UI/UX load testing
-- 150 donors, 12 staff, 14 camps, per-camp registrations,
-- camp finance (contributions/expenses) and message history.
-- Safe to re-run only against a FRESH database (uses plain
-- INSERT, not idempotent) - intended for `docker-entrypoint-
-- initdb.d` on first container boot alongside 01-03.
-- ============================================================

